 it at $(x,y)=(3,1):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f(x,y) & ={f}_{x}(x,y)\\,i+{f}_{y}(x,y)\\,j \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(3 x^{2} + 6 x y^{2} + 6 y^{2})\\,i+\\frac{∂}{∂y}(3 x^{2} + 6 x y^{2} + 6 y^{2})\\,j \\\\  & =(6 x + 6 y^{2})\\,i+(12 x y + 12 y)\\,j \\\\ ∇f(3,1) & =(6 (3) + 6 (1)^{2})\\,i+(12 (3) (1) + 12 (1))\\,j \\\\  & =(24)\\,i+(48)\\,j \\\\  & =⟨24,48⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the Cartesian equation of the tangent line to the level curve that passes through the point $({x}_{0},{y}_{0})$ can be written as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f({x}_{0},{y}_{0})\\cdot ⟨x-{x}_{0},\\,y-{y}_{0}⟩ & =0 \\\\ ∇f(3,1)\\cdot ⟨x-(3),\\,y-(1)⟩ & =0 \\\\ ⟨24,48⟩\\cdot ⟨x - 3,\\,y - 1⟩ & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["aee44b19-384e-57f3-9c07-a81959031578"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "7d40b20a-3844-5ee1-965b-acec820bd31d" :answer/id #uuid "7d40b20a-3844-5ee1-965b-acec820bd31d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨- \\frac{185}{4},- \\frac{55}{2}⟩\\cdot ⟨x + \\frac{3}{2},\\,y - \\frac{5}{2}⟩=0" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "7f241a59-debf-5de1-a40a-8220ae6d711f" :answer/id #uuid "7f241a59-debf-5de1-a40a-8220ae6d711f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\frac{185}{4},- \\frac{55}{2}⟩\\cdot ⟨x + \\frac{3}{2},\\,y + \\frac{5}{2}⟩=0" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "2f284a02-2fb2-5fa7-bd41-576dd3d0bba5" :answer/id #uuid "2f284a02-2fb2-5fa7-bd41-576dd3d0bba5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨- \\frac{55}{2},\\frac{185}{4}⟩\\cdot ⟨x + \\frac{3}{2},\\,y - \\frac{5}{2}⟩=0" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "8a532d49-8d53-5a2f-a45c-6713f991d1b6" :answer/id #uuid "8a532d49-8d53-5a2f-a45c-6713f991d1b6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨\\frac{185}{4},- \\frac{55}{2}⟩\\cdot ⟨x - \\frac{3}{2},\\,y - \\frac{5}{2}⟩=0" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "0ec3cb01-9709-5f4d-b512-edefe3f3ee1a" :answer/id #uuid "0ec3cb01-9709-5f4d-b512-edefe3f3ee1a" :answer/type :answe